  {
   "id": "slaycation-paradise-200679@hotfix-2022-08-26",
   "gameId": "slaycation-paradise-200679",
   "displayName": "Hot Fix 2",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-08-26T11:24:12.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hot Fix 2 - Quality of Life Improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "This one's a bit more than just a hot fix -- there's a bunch of improvements and even a few new things in there...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "FIXES",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where blueprints didn't unlock reliably.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a balance bug where higher rarity drops weren't respecting the loot table rules.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed 12 text legibility issues for Japanese, Russian, Chinese (Traditional), and Spanish languages.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resolved a rare but annoying soft-lock bug when killing two bosses at the exact same time.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "BALANCE",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Minor buffs for a few under-utilised weapons.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased challenge on higher difficulties. You should definitely feel it...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "...but also increased item drop and rarity rate to counter this. Higher difficulty = better and MORE loot.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Nerfed the wand output damage...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "...but increased its inherent Corpse explosion damage. Bigger risk/reward payoff, but harder to solo it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tweaked the blueprint drop rate rules to make it a more fair experience, and less purely random.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "NEW",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "To promote fresh weapons, added an upgrade limit on the number of levels you can invest into a weapon.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added the ability to extinguish some status effects when dodge-rolling. Corrosion/poison/burn/etc.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a secret easter-egg. It's dumb and tiny and I don't recommend trying to find it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "digest": {
