  {
   "id": "slaycation-paradise-200679@hotfix-2022-08-20",
   "gameId": "slaycation-paradise-200679",
   "displayName": "Hot Fix 1 + Demo Updated",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-08-20T09:13:37.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hot Fix 1",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "In addition to the Demo being updated, we've got a quick-fire hot-fix comin' at you:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sightseeing shard rewards are now given and tallied correctly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Disco Mime music now disables correctly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Default Redistributables are now set on the Steam Dashboard; hopeful fix for a number of crash-on-launch bugs.: If you still experience a crash-on-launch, please get in touch and share your log file!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Demo Updated -- The Better-er edition",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The Slaycation DEMO has been updated ːsteamthumbsupː",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A metric slop-bucket of improvements, polish, and updates...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The demo is now representative of the launch version of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Many quality of life updates.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Full localization support (and options menu) for...: * English: * French: * Spanish: * German: * Japanese: * Chinese (Simplified): * Chinese (Traditional): * Russian",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Many stability improvements and bug fixes. Most notably...: * Sightseeing shard rewards are given and tallied correctly.: * Fixes missing text displays.: * Resolves that annoying motion-blur-disabled bug! Yes. That one :O: NOTE: if you have any issues updating the demo, make sure to try verifying the install files: 1) Right click on your library > Slaycation Paradise Demo > Properties...: 2) Local Files > Verify integrity of demo files.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
